ryption will take place in Seattle, USA, on April 4th 2027. The conference will feature presentation sessions, poster sessions, invited speakers, and our usual after party.\n\nFor updates, make sure to subscribe to the FHE.org newsletter.\n\nImportant dates\nSubmission deadline: November 1, 2026 (23:59 AoE)\nNotification: December 18, 2026\nConference date: April 4, 2027\nLatest updates\n2026.07.01: Conference website online\n2026.07.08: Program Chairs announced (David Archer and Rachel Player)\n2026.07.31: Submission deadline and notification date posted\n2026.08.04: Call for presentations posted\nSponsors\nInterested in showing your support for FHE research and development through your company? Consider sponsoring this or future conferences just as our 2026 sponsors have. Reach out to us at contact@fhe.org.\n\nICW-IACR\nFHE.org 2027 is held in cooperation with IACR (ICW-IACR).","banner":"https://sbcbnzaajijsbkrjsmec.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event_submission_banners/FHEorgConference2027_2026-09-25T15-06.png","starred":false,"event":"FHE.org Conference","startDate":"2027-04-04","endDate":"2027-04-04","timeOverride":null,"city":["Seattle"],"country":["USA 🇺🇸"],"region":["North America"],"timezone":["America/Los_Angeles"],"link":"https://fhe.org/conferences/conference-2027/","organizer":"fhe_org","twitter":null,"telegram":null,"tags":["Conference","Other"],"topics":["Privacy","Security"],"usersGoingObj":[{"handle":"fhe_org","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","name":"fhe_org","followerCount":0,"airtableId":"recNwyCSgufDAHyUI"}],"usersInterestedObj":[],"benefits":null,"series":[{"id":"recTOZu8qxBKZIzmy","title":"RWC Events","color":"#E5E894","slug":"RWCEvents2027","shortSlug":"RWCE2027","visible":true,"clickable":false,"logo":"https://media.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExN2t5ZHhtdjBhdXNhOHBhd3F4YmxtZWFiOTMybjRoeXVwdG1qbDZ0NSZlcD12MV9zdGlja2Vyc19zZWFyY2gmY3Q9cw/XCsViayYkxVBnXiW7Z/giphy.gif","banner":""}],"slug":"FHE.org-Conference-2027-WJ","shortSlug":