le. Kaiko built The Agora to focus this conversation and bring the right people together on a neutral platform to shape the future of digital assets in the financial ecosystem. From Standard Chartered, Euronext, and Fidelity, to S\u0026P Global, Bloomberg, and DRW, The Agora brings the biggest players to the table to discuss how these future markets are built, regulated, and traded.\n\nThe event focuses on the key issues defining the future of institutional digital finance, including:\n\nStablecoins and settlement infrastructure\nTokenized collateral\nDerivatives markets\nOnchain capital markets \u0026 liquidity\nOnchain regulatory compliance\nHosted by Kaiko, the global leader in digital asset data and infrastructure,...","banner":null,"starred":false,"event":"The Agora","startDate":"2027-04-13","endDate":"2027-04-13","timeOverride":null,"city":["Cannes"],"country":["France 🇫🇷"],"region":["Europe"],"timezone":["Europe/Paris"],"link":"https://agora.kaiko.com/","organizer":"Kaiko","twitter":null,"telegram":null,"tags":["Conference","Multichain"],"topics":["Institutional","Markets","Stablecoins"],"usersGoingObj":[{"handle":"kaikodata","avatar":"https://sbcbnzaajijsbkrjsmec.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/company_logos/rec5FRSjcf0TJFO0J.png","name":"Kaiko","followerCount":19925,"airtableId":"recB3mt0jg5f3Ggso"},{"handle":"3615crypto","avatar":"https://sbcbnzaajijsbkrjsmec.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/profile_images/recW3bFICjLkPumoF_2025-10-08T11:18.png","name":"San Clemente","followerCount":1199,"airtableId":"recW3bFICjLkPumoF"}],"usersInterestedObj":[{"handle":"0x51111b238dDC12d84c893487384E577c47095846","avatar":"https://sbcbnzaajijsbkrjsmec.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/profile_images/recon4COokNg2hpJ8_2026-09-03T19-32.png","name":"shellych12","followerCount":0,"airtableId":"recon4COokNg2hpJ8"}],"benefits":null,"series":[{"id":"recxfyaZwSB6HyO22","title":"EthCC 10 Events","color":"#CBF2CA","slug":"EthCC10Events2027","shortSlug":"EthCCE2027","vis