 moving onchain, bringing traditional institutions and the digital asset ecosystem closer together.\n\nEBC is built to bring those worlds under the same roof.\n\nInstitutions at the Center\nBanks, asset managers and incumbents are leading the shift. EBC puts them at the center of the event, and connects them with the technology, capital and partners they need.\n\nEurope in One Place\nEurope’s digital asset market is spread across dozens of financial hubs. EBC brings the continent together, compressing months of travel into two days.\nDeal-Making by Design\nPre-arranged meetings, curated introductions and dedicated formats help the right people find each other.\n\nThe Barcelona Effect\nMeeting away from the office creates a different dynamic. Barcelona creates longer conversations, stronger relationships and ultimately better business.","banner":null,"starred":false,"event":"European Blockchain\nConvention 13","startDate":"2027-09-23","endDate":"2027-09-24","timeOverride":null,"city":["Barcelona"],"country":["Spain 🇪🇸"],"region":["Europe"],"timezone":["Europe/Madrid"],"link":"https://eblockchainconvention.com/european-blockchain-convention-13/","organizer":"European Blockchain Convention","twitter":null,"telegram":null,"tags":["Conference","Multichain"],"topics":["TradFi","Infrastructure","Institutional"],"usersGoingObj":[{"handle":"eblockchaincon","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1950216496078024704/TVIh9hwR_400x400.png","name":"European Blockchain Convention","followerCount":0,"airtableId":"receaDkQA87qGo1k3"}],"usersInterestedObj":[],"benefits":null,"series":[{"id":"recb25UYssqLd091r","title":"European Blockchain Events","color":"#CBF2CA","slug":"EuropeanBlockchainEvents2027","shortSlug":"EurBE2027","visible":true,"clickable":false,"logo":"https://media0.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExYWVtamg2OXowbmMwNnBvMjl1c3JoNmUybGFlb2licG4zZ3JxbDY4NSZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9cw/H1pZ9SH1vGVNxixndH/giphy.gif","banner":"https://sbcbnzaajijsbkrjsmec.